equally common in every country."],"correctIndex":1},"highlightPrompt":"Highlight the sentence that carries the key claim described in the question.","sentenceOptions":["Each sheet has the same proportions, so folding or enlarging it preserves the shape.","A mature canopy intercepts rainfall before it reaches the pavement, which reduces the volume of water that storm drains must carry during heavy storms.","During deep sleep, the hippocampus replays sequences of the day in compressed bursts, while the cortex gradually incorporates those patterns into longer-term storage.","The pattern repeated: private credit came first, public currency followed, and inflation punished the issuers who ignored the difference between a promise and a reserve."]}',
